  "worked_solution": "First, let's rewrite the phrase \"it is positive or rational\" as the equivalent phrase \"it is positive or it is rational.\" The sentence now reads\n\n\"$x$ is positive, or it is positive or it is rational.\"\n\nThen, using the associative law, we can move the comma:\n\n\"$x$ is positive or it is positive, or it is rational.\"\n\nNow, we can simplify the phrase \"$x$ is positive or it is positive\" to just \"$x$ is positive.\" The sentence now reads\n\n\"$x$ is positive, or it is rational.\"\n\nFinally, we can write the sentence more concisely as\n\n\"$x$ is positive or rational.\"",
